{"meta":{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vTW92aWVzL0hvbGx5d29vZC8xOTk5LS1CZWZvcmUvV2VsY29tZSUyMEhvbWUlMkMlMjBSb3h5JTIwQ2FybWljaGFlbCUyMCUyODE5OTAlMjkv","type":"movie","name":"Welcome Home, Roxy Carmichael","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/7ygtZksyPjzkjdFL036YfnSTc1F.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/snNj2CZeaBHkP5xT5ep1efxa6rY.jpg","description":"Movie star Roxy Carmichael is abandoning the bright lights of Hollywood, Calif. and returning to her small Ohio hometown -- at least long enough to dedicate a city building. And now the whole town of Clyde is bracing for Carmichael's return, most of all her now-married old flame Denton Webb and troubled teen Dinky Bossetti. An orphan with few friends, Dinky is convinced that Carmichael is her birth mother, and that the actress will reclaim her when she returns.","releaseInfo":"1990","genres":["Comedy","Drama","Hollywood"],"imdbRating":"6.1","runtime":"95 min","cast":["Winona Ryder","Jeff Daniels","Stephen Tobolowsky","Dinah Manoff","Laila Robins","Thomas Wilson Brown","Joan McMurtrey","Graham Beckel"],"director":["Jim Abrahams"],"released":"1990-10-12T00:00:00.000Z","slogan":"She doesn't want much. Just a whole new life.","app_extras":{"cast":[{"name":"Winona Ryder","character":"Dinky Bossetti","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/8RVrlgtua8b53wmK7oZAAkm0N5O.jpg"},{"name":"Jeff Daniels","character":"Denton Webb","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/r0mkZJZnTSJO3HJRsMW5HtszxE8.jpg"},{"name":"Stephen Tobolowsky","character":"Mayor Bill Klepler","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/uL8yfcm0dCFYFQt052kczVQVvac.jpg"},{"name":"Dinah Manoff","character":"Evelyn Whittacher","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/1aQPGY5I5fB2KZPGItr6o6BY6qG.jpg"},{"name":"Laila Robins","character":"Elizabeth Zaks","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/ucHMLT7IUaWkd64ZPHtWjqxx8rq.jpg"},{"name":"Thomas Wilson Brown","character":"Gerald Howells","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/yKmvt0Ug